atar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1919,"digest":"sha256:3cb4e8120e37b5c45ca869b481775b5f01a9e9a93897d9e7e25ceaebb24a248b","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-25T04:15:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:15:58Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.111.1/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.111.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.111.1","body":"This patch makes Steam Deck menu confirmation reliable when Steam Input and Chromium expose one A press through more than one input channel.\n\n- Treats the controller South/A press as the owner of the gesture and suppresses a separate trusted keyboard or click echo, including click-only echoes delayed by Steam Input.\n- Keeps the controller adapter’s intentional `HTMLElement.click()` activation and ordinary touch, mouse, and keyboard input working.\n- Covers title-menu actions, dropdown choices, Start Mission, Sound, Settings/More, and paused-menu actions including Resume and Home.\n- Keeps the controller instruction banner hidden so it cannot overlap gameplay.\n\nFocused validation passed 221 controller/navigation checks plus lint, formatting, source validation, the hosted PR preflight/build/release gate, exact merged-source gates, immutable freeze, whole-artifact inspection, and consumer verification of the seven small release attachments. The first freeze attempt was preserved after correctly detecting a stale 0.111.0 build-config value; PR #470 aligned the exact release identity before this qualification. Automated long test shards remain waived under the repository’s explicit fast-release policy and are not claimed as passed.\n\nSource: `cd9565357add4d1521faae76e6d029446b6d8503`\nTree: `48f4fb7fbfd8355771eafbe2bd8db80f0a2840b6`\nQualification: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36092735215\nArtifact inspection: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36093408087\nEvidence assembly: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36093598836\n\nPhysical Steam Deck confirmation and public Pages browser acceptance remain separate until the deployed build is exercised."}